      "hints": [
        "Differentiate the implicit equation, applying the chain rule to $\\ln(x+y)$.",
        "Collect the $dy/dx$ terms and solve algebraically for the gradient."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Use the chain rule to differentiate the left side",
        "Obtain $\\frac1{x+y}(1+\\frac{dy}{dx})$",
        "Equate it to $1-2\\frac{dy}{dx}$ and solve for $dy/dx$",
        "Obtain the given answer correctly",
        "$\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{x+y-1}{2(x+y)+1}$."
      ],
